OL,3,GNEWSAHolme Fen fire stood down as major
OL,4,Aincident
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire that engulfed about half of a
OL,7,Fnature reserve has been stood down as a
OL,8,Fmajor incident more than two weeks
OL,9,Fafter the blaze broke out.
OL,11,FAt its peak about 100 firefighters were
OL,12,Fcalled to tackle the blaze at Holme
OL,13,FFen, near Peterborough, with crews due
OL,14,Fto remain there until at least
OL,15,Fmid-September.
OL,17,FFirefighters from across the country,
OL,18,Fincluding Merseyside, who had travelled
OL,19,Fto help with the incident have been
OL,20,Fwithdrawn.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
